  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Revision of AMG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is that the AMG site is clear, precise and pedagogical for staff by providing
support during the preparation and the implementation of development cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall purpose of the assignment to improve the efficiency and quality of the administration of development cooperation.

The revision work related to the AMG primarily concerns assistance to the preparation of formats, templates, annexes, checklists, including a new guidance note on results reporting  as well as QA of existing documents with special focus on better integration of HDP and greening.</narrative>
  </description>
